<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="csrf-token" content="{{ csrf_token() }}"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><title>CITEPOST — RAG Reliability Lab · Syslora</title><meta name="description" content="Inspect retrieval, verify citations and measure when your RAG should refuse to answer.">@vite(['resources/js/app.js'])</head>
<body x-data="lab">
<header class="topbar"><a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Citepost home"><span class="logo">C<span>]</span></span>CITEPOST<span class="brand-detail">/ RELIABILITY LAB</span></a><div class="top-actions"><span class="badge"><i></i> PUBLIC DEMO</span><a href="https://syslora.com/work" class="quiet-link">Built by Syslora ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/IonGlavan1801/citepost" class="quiet-link">Source ↗</a></div></header>
<main>
<section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE BEFORE CONFIDENCE</p><h1>Answers with a<br><em>paper trail.</em></h1><p class="intro-copy">RAG you can inspect, measure and refuse<br class="desktop"> when the evidence isn't there.</p></div><div class="flow-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="flow-dot">01 <span>DOCUMENTS</span></div><div class="connector"></div><div class="flow-dot">02 <span>RETRIEVAL</span></div><div class="connector"></div><div class="flow-dot accent">03 <span>EVIDENCE</span></div><p>EVERY ANSWER HAS A SOURCE.<br>EVERY REFUSAL HAS A REASON.</p></div></section>
<div class="lab-heading"><h2><span class="live-dot"></span> The workbench</h2><span class="mono" x-text="state.groq_configured ? 'GROQ CLOUD + LOCAL ONNX' : 'RETRIEVAL READY / GROQ NOT CONFIGURED'"></span></div>
<div class="mobile-tabs"><template x-for="name in ['documents','chat','inspector']"><button @click="mobile=name" :class="{'active':mobile===name}" x-text="name"></button></template></div>
<section class="workbench">
<aside class="documents pane" :class="{'mobile-active':mobile==='documents'}"><div class="pane-title"><h3>Documents</h3><span class="tiny">01</span></div><p class="caption">CHOOSE YOUR CORPUS</p><div class="corpus-list"><template x-for="item in [{id:'manual',label:'Product manual',sub:'Procedures & exact error codes'},{id:'contract',label:'Service contract',sub:'Clauses, obligations & exceptions'},{id:'policies',label:'Company policies',sub:'Rules & versioned information'},{id:'upload',label:'Your documents',sub:'Private to this temporary session'}]"><button class="corpus" :class="{'selected':collection===item.id}" @click="collection=item.id"><span class="doc-icon">▤</span><span><strong x-text="item.label"></strong><small x-text="item.sub"></small></span><span class="arrow">↗</span></button></template></div>
<label class="upload"><input type="file" accept="application/pdf" @change="upload($event)" :disabled="uploading"><span x-text="uploading ? 'Uploading…' : '+ Upload a PDF'"></span></label><p class="fine">Text-based PDF · 5 MB · 60 pages<br>3 uploads / session · automatically purged after 2 hours. Extracted passages are sent to GroqCloud to answer your questions.</p>
<div class="document-items"><template x-for="doc in docs" :key="doc.id"><article class="document-item"><div><strong x-text="doc.title"></strong><span class="badge mini" x-text="doc.synthetic?'SYNTHETIC':'USER UPLOAD'"></span></div><p><span class="status-dot" :class="doc.status"></span><span x-text="doc.ingestion?.status || doc.status"></span><span x-text="doc.ingestion?.pages ? ' · '+doc.ingestion.pages+' pages · v'+doc.ingestion.number : ''"></span></p><div class="ingestion"><template x-for="step in doc.ingestion?.steps || []"><span :title="ms(step.ms)" x-text="step.stage"></span></template></div><p class="fine" x-show="doc.ingestion?.metadata?.error" x-text="doc.ingestion?.metadata?.error"></p><div class="doc-tools"><button @click="reindex(doc.id)">Reindex</button><button @click="remove(doc.id)">Remove</button><a :href="'/api/sources/'+doc.active_version" target="_blank" rel="noopener" x-show="doc.active_version">Open PDF ↗</a></div></article></template><p class="fine" x-show="!docs.length">No documents in this collection yet.</p></div>
</aside>
<section class="chat pane" :class="{'mobile-active':mobile==='chat'}"><div class="pane-title"><h3>Ask the corpus</h3><span class="tiny">02</span></div><div class="query-controls"><label class="sr-only" for="mode">Retrieval mode</label><select id="mode" x-model="mode"><option value="hybrid_rerank">Hybrid + rerank</option><option value="hybrid">Hybrid / RRF</option><option value="vector">Vector only</option><option value="lexical">Lexical only</option></select><label class="compare"><input type="checkbox" x-model="compare">Compare retrieval</label></div>
<div class="conversation"><div class="empty-chat" x-show="!messages.length"><div class="evidence-symbol">[ <span>↗</span> ]</div><h3>Trust starts with inspection.</h3><p>Pick a question. Follow its evidence.<br>See exactly what made it into the answer.</p><div class="guided"><button @click="guided(0)"><span>01</span> Ask a grounded question ↗</button><button @click="guided(1)"><span>02</span> Test an exact identifier ↗</button><button @click="guided(3)"><span>03</span> Compare vector vs hybrid ↗</button><button @click="guided(2)"><span>04</span> Try an unanswerable question ↗</button></div></div>
<template x-for="message in messages" :key="message.id"><article class="exchange"><div class="user-question"><span class="caption">YOUR QUESTION</span><p x-text="message.question"></p></div><div class="answer"><div class="answer-heading"><span class="badge" :class="message.answer.status" x-text="message.answer.status==='grounded'?'GROUNDED':message.answer.status==='insufficient'?'INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE':'CONTROLLED FAILURE'"></span><span class="fine" x-text="ms(message.trace.total_ms)"></span></div><template x-for="sentence in message.answer.sentences"><p class="answer-sentence"><span x-text="sentence.text"></span> <template x-for="id in sentence.source_ids"><button class="citation" @click="cite(message,id)" :aria-label="'Open source '+id" x-text="'['+id.substring(1)+']'"></button></template></p></template><p x-show="message.answer.message" x-text="message.answer.message"></p><div class="answer-footer"><button @click="selected=message;mobile='inspector'">Inspect retrieval ↗</button><span x-text="money(message.answer.usage.estimated_cost)+' estimated'"></span><button @click="feedback(message,'helpful')" aria-label="Mark answer helpful">＋ Helpful</button></div></div></article></template><div class="loading" x-show="busy" x-cloak><i></i> Retrieving sources and checking the evidence…</div><div id="conversation-bottom"></div></div>
<div class="composer"><form @submit.prevent="ask()"><label class="sr-only" for="question">Ask a question</label><textarea id="question" x-model="question" placeholder="Ask something the documents can answer…" rows="2" maxlength="1000" @keydown.ctrl.enter.prevent="ask()"></textarea><button class="send" type="submit" :disabled="busy||!question.trim()" aria-label="Send question">↗</button></form><div class="composer-note"><span>ANSWERS ONLY FROM YOUR CORPUS</span><button @click="guided(2)">Test abstention ↗</button></div></div>
</section>
<aside class="inspector pane" :class="{'mobile-active':mobile==='inspector'}"><div class="pane-title"><h3>Retrieval Inspector</h3><span class="tiny">03</span></div><div class="inspector-tabs"><template x-for="name in ['pipeline','candidates','context','prompt','usage']"><button :class="{'active':tab===name}" @click="tab=name" x-text="name"></button></template></div>
<div class="inspector-empty" x-show="!selected"><span class="crosshair">⊕</span><h4>Nothing hidden.</h4><p>Run a query to inspect candidate ranks, selected context, evidence checks and measured usage.</p><div class="pipeline-preview"><span>Query</span><b>↓</b><span>Lexical + vector</span><b>↓</b><span>Fusion → rerank</span><b>↓</b><span>Evidence → answer</span></div></div>
<template x-if="selected"><div class="inspector-body"><div class="trace-flags"><span class="badge mini" x-show="selected.trace.simulated">SIMULATED FAILURE</span><span class="badge mini warning" x-show="selected.trace.fallback">RERANKER FALLBACK</span></div>
<div x-show="tab==='pipeline'"><p class="caption">NORMALIZED QUERY</p><p class="code" x-text="selected.trace.normalized"></p><template x-for="[stage,msValue] in Object.entries(selected.trace.timings)"><div class="timing-row"><span x-text="stage.replaceAll('_',' ')"></span><b x-text="ms(msValue)"></b><div class="timing-track"><i :style="'width:'+Math.max(3,Math.min(100,msValue/selected.trace.retrieval_ms*100))+'%'"></i></div></div></template><div class="evidence-check"><span class="caption">EVIDENCE GATE</span><h4 x-text="selected.trace.evidence.sufficient?'Support threshold passed':'Insufficient support'"></h4><p x-text="selected.trace.evidence.policy"></p><p class="fine" x-text="'Threshold: '+selected.trace.evidence.threshold+' · exact IDs: '+(selected.trace.evidence.exact_identifier_match?'covered':'not covered')"></p></div><template x-if="selected.trace.comparison"><div><p class="caption">SAME QUERY / SAME CORPUS</p><template x-for="row in selected.trace.comparison"><details class="comparison"><summary><span x-text="label(row.mode)"></span><b x-text="ms(row.ms)"></b></summary><template x-for="c in row.top"><p class="fine"><span x-text="c.section"></span> · p.<span x-text="c.page"></span></p></template></details></template></div></template></div>
<div x-show="tab==='candidates'"><p class="fine">Raw lexical and vector scores use different scales. Fusion uses reciprocal ranks.</p><div class="candidate-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Source / passage</th><th>L</th><th>V</th><th>F</th><th>R</th></tr></thead><tbody><template x-for="c in selected.trace.candidates"><tr><td><span class="badge mini" x-text="c.source"></span><strong x-text="c.section"></strong><small x-text="'p.'+c.page+' · '+c.status"></small><small x-text="'vector '+Number(c.vector_score||0).toFixed(3)+' / rerank '+Number(c.rerank_score||0).toFixed(3)"></small></td><td x-text="c.lexical_rank||'–'"></td><td x-text="c.vector_rank||'–'"></td><td x-text="c.fusion_rank||'–'"></td><td x-text="c.rerank_rank||'–'"></td></tr></template></tbody></table></div></div>
<div x-show="tab==='context'"><p class="fine">Exact passages supplied to the model when the evidence gate passes. Token counts are character-based estimates.</p><template x-for="c in selected.trace.context"><article class="context-card"><div class="caption"><span x-text="c.source_id"></span><span x-text="c.tokens+' est. tokens'"></span></div><h4 x-text="c.section"></h4><p x-text="c.content"></p><button @click="source=c">Open page <span x-text="c.page"></span> ↗</button></article></template></div>
<div x-show="tab==='prompt'"><p class="caption">ANSWERING TEMPLATE</p><p class="code prompt" x-text="selected.trace.prompt_template"></p><p class="fine">Documents are untrusted data. Authorization and source ID validation run in Laravel. These controls reduce risk; they do not prove every claim is faithful.</p></div>
<div x-show="tab==='usage'"><div class="usage-grid"><div><small>TOTAL</small><strong x-text="ms(selected.trace.total_ms)"></strong></div><div><small>ESTIMATED COST</small><strong x-text="money(selected.answer.usage.estimated_cost)"></strong></div><div><small>INPUT TOKENS</small><strong x-text="selected.answer.usage.input_tokens"></strong></div><div><small>OUTPUT TOKENS</small><strong x-text="selected.answer.usage.output_tokens"></strong></div></div><p class="fine" x-text="'GroqCloud / '+selected.answer.usage.model"></p><p class="fine" x-text="'Embedding: '+selected.trace.config.embedding"></p><p class="fine" x-text="'Reranker: '+(selected.trace.config.reranker||'not run / fallback')"></p><p class="fine" x-text="'LLM total '+ms(selected.answer.usage.llm_ms)+' · TTFT not measured (validated non-streaming)'"></p><p class="caption">CORRELATION ID</p><p class="code" x-text="selected.id"></p><p class="caption">INDEX SNAPSHOT</p><template x-for="id in selected.trace.indexes"><p class="code" x-text="id"></p></template><p class="fine">Pricing: Groq model rates verified 12 Oct 2026. Estimated provider cost excludes hosting CPU. No retrieval cache.</p></div>
</div></template>
</aside></section>
<p class="error-banner" x-show="error" x-cloak x-text="error" role="alert"></p><p class="notice" x-show="notice" x-cloak x-text="notice" role="status"></p>
<section class="lower"><div class="failure-panel"><p class="eyebrow">CONTROLLED FAILURE LAB</p><h3>What happens when<br>the pipeline breaks?</h3><label for="failure" class="fine">Next query failure injection (explicitly simulated)</label><select id="failure" x-model="failure"><option value="none">No failure</option><option value="reranker_timeout">Reranker timeout → fused fallback</option><option value="empty_retrieval">Empty retrieval → abstention</option><option value="weak_retrieval">Weak evidence → abstention</option><option value="llm_timeout">LLM timeout → controlled failure</option></select><p class="fine">Failure injection affects only your query, never an external provider.</p></div><div class="evaluation-panel"><p class="eyebrow">MEASURED, NOT PROMISED</p><h3>Evaluation ledger</h3><template x-if="state.evaluation"><div><p class="fine" x-text="state.evaluation.count+' held-out cases · '+state.evaluation.dataset+' · '+state.evaluation.timestamp"></p><div class="eval-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Recall@5</th><th>MRR</th><th>p95</th></tr></thead><tbody><template x-for="row in state.evaluation.modes"><tr><td x-text="label(row.mode)"></td><td x-text="(row.recall5*100).toFixed(1)+'%'"></td><td x-text="row.mrr.toFixed(3)"></td><td x-text="ms(row.p95_ms)"></td></tr></template></tbody></table></div><p class="fine" x-text="'Abstention precision / recall: '+state.evaluation.abstention_precision.toFixed(2)+' / '+state.evaluation.abstention_recall.toFixed(2)"></p><p class="fine">Evidence-gate metrics, not an LLM correctness verdict. Dataset and raw run are available in the public repository.</p></div></template><p class="fine" x-show="!state.evaluation">The evaluation runner has not recorded a result yet. No performance claim is shown.</p></div></section>
<section class="limits"><span class="caption">THIS LAB'S BOUNDARIES</span><p>Synthetic English corpora, text-based PDFs and heuristic structural chunking. Source passages are highlighted beside a PDF opened at the cited page; pixel-level highlighting and OCR are not supported. Citation validation checks provenance, not factual truth. RAG and prompt-injection defenses can still fail. Uploaded files and query traces are purged after the two-hour session expires.</p></section>
<footer><span>CITEPOST / A SYSLORA PORTFOLIO LAB</span><a href="https://syslora.com">syslora.com ↗</a></footer>
</main>
<div class="modal" x-show="source" x-cloak @keydown.escape.window="source=null" @click.self="source=null" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Citation source"><template x-if="source"><div class="source-dialog"><div class="pane-title"><div><h3 x-text="source.title"></h3><p class="fine" x-text="'Version '+source.number+' · page '+source.page+' · '+source.section"></p></div><button @click="source=null" class="close" aria-label="Close source">×</button></div><div class="source-split"><div><span class="caption">CITED PASSAGE</span><p class="highlight" x-text="source.content"></p><p class="fine">Passage highlight is shown here; the PDF opens at the source page.</p><a :href="'/api/sources/'+source.version_id+'#page='+source.page" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open original PDF ↗</a></div><iframe :src="'/api/sources/'+source.version_id+'#page='+source.page" title="Source document at cited page"></iframe></div></div></template></div>
</body></html>
